1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:13,242
Writing, task one. Form number 18. You want to buy a swimming pool pass. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:15,399
How well can you swim?

3
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,030
I can swim well, but I want to learn to swim front crawl better.

4
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:31,537
Why do you want to go swimming?

5
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:45,694
I want to go swimming because my back hurts and swimming is healthy.

6
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,360
When will you go to the pool?

7
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:03,072
I will go to the pool twice a week in the morning before work, on Monday and Thursday.

8
00:01:03,967 --> 00:01:13,202
Fill in form 18 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
